# Probe board: the crab is pushed along the channel and PARKS. The player picks the
# approach direction by rotating r2c1 / r1c2, and the crab parks in a different
# pocket depending on which way the water reaches it. One pocket is harmless; the
# other parks the crab on the route to the second critter.
id: 83
name: Crab Parks Somewhere
size: 5x5
par: 3
tide: 9
source: r2c0
grid:
  .. .. I0 .. ..
  .. .. I0 .. ..
  e1 I1 x0 I1 e3
  .. .. I0 .. ..
  .. .. e0 .. ..
critters:
  r2c4 starfish
  r4c2 anemone
crabs:
  r2c2
solution:
  r2c1 cw1
  r2c3 cw1
  r1c2 cw1
